neNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Florida State's first turquoise football uniforms are a tribute to Seminole Tribe","description":"Florida State's turquoise uniforms are a tribute to the Seminole Tribe of Florida.","published":"2026-11-16T01:03:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50495730/florida-state-football-turquoise-uniforms-seminole-tribe","type":"Story","byline":"Anthony Gharib","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Oklahoma, boosted by crowd's ire at postponement, beats No. 19 Ole Miss","description":"The Oklahoma crowd let Ole Miss know what they thought of having their game delayed by a day, and the Sooners rode that energy to a 24-17 win over the Rebels.","published":"2026-11-16T00:22:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50495687/sooners-boosted-crowd-ire-postponement-beat-rebels","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football SP+ rankings for all 138 FBS teams","description":"The updated SP+ rankings, plus strength of schedule and résumé SP+, after this weekend's results.","published":"2026-11-15T22:56:34.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49868647/2026-college-football-sp+-rankings-all-138-fbs-teams","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sizing up college football's best races down the homestretch","description":"From spots in the CFP and SEC title game to the hunt for bowl eligibility, there's still a lot on the line.","published":"2026-11-15T22:17:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50491637/connelly-college-football-best-races","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"SEC fines Arkansas $500K for allowing fans to storm field vs. South Carolina","description":"The Southeastern Conference fined Arkansas $500,000 on Sunday for allowing fans to storm the field following a 34-6 victory over No. 17 South Carolina.","published":"2026-11-15T22:01:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50493903/sec-fines-arkansas-500k-allowing-fans-storm-field-vs-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Clemson QB Tait Reynolds has torn meniscus, Christopher Vizzina a concussion","description":"Clemson lost starting QB Tait Reynolds for the rest of the season with a torn meniscus, while backup Christopher Vizzina has a concussion.","published":"2026-11-15T21:09:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50493355/reynolds-torn-meniscus-vizzina-concussion","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Minnesota fires OC Greg Harbaugh Jr., ending third stint with Gophers","description":"Minnesota fired offensive coordinator Greg Harbaugh Jr. as the Golden Gophers rank 15th in the Big Ten in scoring and 17th in yards per game.","published":"2026-11-15T19:36:27.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50491908/minnesota-fires-oc-greg-harbaugh-jr-ending-3rd-gophers-stint","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Allstate Playoff Predictor","description":"Select your favorite contender, make your picks for how its season will play out and see what the Allstate Playoff Predictor foretells.","published":"2026-11-15T18:13:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/page/cfbplayoffpredictor/college-football-allstate-playoff-bracket-predictor","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079580/mike-matthews","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Matthews_(wide_receiver)"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Mike Matthews (wide receiver)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Matthews_(wide_receiver)","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-14T21:00:40Z","intro":"Michael Allen Matthews (born October 25, 2005) is an American college football wide receiver for the Tennessee Volunteers.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Matthews attended Parkview High School in Lilburn, Georgia. He played wide receiver and defensive back in high school. As a senior in 2023, he was the 2023 Region 4-7A Player of the Year after recording 39 receptions for 751 yards and nine touchdowns on offense and 48 tackles and an interception on defense. Matthews played in the 2024 Under Armour All-America Game. A five-star recruit, he committed to the University of Tennessee to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Matthews played in 11 games his true freshman year at Tennessee and had seven receptions for 90 yards and two touchdowns. After the season he entered the transfer portal, but removed his name and returned to Tennessee in 2025."}]}}